          "notes": [
            {
              "chapter": 8,
              "v_start": 14,
              "v_end": 14,
              "text": "And the apostles hearing that Samaria — The inhabitants of that country, had received the word of God - By faith, sent Peter and John - He that sends must be either superior, or at least equal, to him that is sent. It follows that the college of the apostles was equal if not superior to Peter."
            },
            {
              "chapter": 8,
              "v_start": 15,
              "v_end": 15,
              "text": "The Holy Ghost — In his miraculous gifts? Or his sanctifying graces? Probably in both."
            }
          ]
        },
